@@ -0,0 +1,28 @@
+**Added:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Changed:**
+
+* The default lambda schedule for VdW decoupling in the vacuum leg of the
+  AbsoluteSolvationProtocol has been amended to remove redundant windows
+  where the LJ interactions were being scaled even though there are no
+  nonbonded interactions in vacuum. (`PR #2241 <https://github.com/OpenFreeEnergy/openfe/pull/2241>`_).
+* The AbsoluteSolvationProtocol now has separate lambda settings for
+  the solvent and vacuum legs. (`PR #2241 <https://github.com/OpenFreeEnergy/openfe/pull/2241>`_).
+
+**Deprecated:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Removed:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Fixed:**
+
+* <news item>
+
+**Security:**
